  },
  "domain": "Banking",
  "description": "One case per overdue loan (from the LMS end-of-day): SMA-0/1/2 and NPA classification by days past due, CRILC reporting for large exposures, reminders on registered templates, contact by a recovery agent within permitted hours, promise to pay, restructuring or one-time settlement sanctioned with maker-checker, SARFAESI s.13(2) demand notice with the 60-day window and the reply to a representation within 15 days, s.13(4) measures.",
